; A ring in each of the three relations which can hold one: containment, frame
; parents in the file beside this, and claim supersession.
;
; None of them is a dangling reference — every id here names something the model
; holds — which is why a cycle is reported as a cycle rather than as something
; missing. Following any of them never terminates, and a load which resolved
; without asking would run until it ran out of stack.
